# Allow-list for `docker build -f infra/deploy/Dockerfile .` (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Secrets (.env), runtime data (var/), private notes and the web app never enter the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!services/
!packages/schemas/
!tools/
!eval/reports/
!data/replays/
!data/synthetic/samples/
!infra/deploy/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/tests/
**/.env
**/.env.*
